39.6850393700787407 518.7403937007873083 Td
(3. Technological Solution: Deterministic 5-Step Pipeline) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
39.6850393700787407 505.9844881889763428 Td
(LunarSafe resolves this challenge through a standardized deterministic state machine consisting of five) Tj
T* (strictly chained modules:) Tj
T* (1. PDS4 Ingestion & Grayscale Normalization: Strict rejection of chromatic aberrations.) Tj
T* (2. Horn \(1981\) Slope Computation: 3rd-order weighted 3◊3 stencil providing true physical slope gradient.) Tj
T* (3. Morphological Hazard Segmentation: Sobel spatial edge detection segmenting steep rims and boulders.) Tj
T* (4. ISRO 24m Standard Grid Discretization: Terrain classified into Safe, Warning, and Hazard cells matching) Tj
T* (landing leg span.) Tj
T* (5. Cascading SHA-256 HMAC Sealing: Cryptographic evidence chain guaranteeing bit-level reproducibility.) Tj
